OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans say horse therapy has
OL,4,Ahelped them feel 'more in control'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA military veteran has said spending
OL,7,Ftime with horses at a therapy centre
OL,8,Fnear Ross-on-Wye has given him back a
OL,9,Fsense of "some control" in his life.
OL,11,FPhillip Howells admitted he had been
OL,12,Fsurprised by his own mental health
OL,13,Fstruggles and that he felt as though he
OL,14,Fhad been "at the bottom of a well".
OL,16,F"When your health deteriorates,
OL,17,Fparticularly your mental health, it's
OL,18,Fhard to get out of it... it's really
OL,19,Fdifficult when you've been used to
OL,20,Fbeing in control to then feel you're
OL,21,Fnot on top of things."
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
